            <ArticleTitle>Benzazepinone Nav1.7 blockers: potential treatments for neuropathic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6172-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A series of benzazepinones were synthesized and evaluated as hNa(v)1.7 sodium channel blockers. Several compounds from this series displayed good oral bioavailability and exposure and were efficacious in a rat model of neuropathic pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
